window.products.push({"id":433040,"name":"God Bless Baptism Banner,Holy Communion Party Christening Decoration Pink Cross-Girl,Beautiful Burlap Decor,Bonus Storage Bag,Handmade Versatile Usage","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81R+eItG2wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Very beautiful Versatile and Reusable banner Ceremonies will take on a whole new meaning with this Fair burlap banner. Better quality and look than any other banners.People love Fair banners! With this beautiful burlap banner, vibrant pink and white paint, your ceremony/ place will look attractive, holy, refreshing & welcoming, creating a pleasant happy environment. The GOD BLESS message keeps the positive vibes flowing & gives you more reasons to celebrate or just hang at your place as a delightful decor. A cute convenient storage bag is included to store the banner when not in use. For first Holy Communion, Baptism, Christening, Baby shower, Church/ Home decor & more... Use it as a perfect decoration for a First Holy Communion, Christening, Baptism, Baby shower party or Celebrating a birth. This is a confirmation of God's Promise. You will experience a feel good factor with the banner hanging around with its lovely message & design. Hang this God Bless Banner at your special event or in a baby's room. It can also be used at church, home, garden etc. as a decor to give that delightful feel to any place or ceremony. Generous ~41” Banner It is ~41 inch long and stringed jute rope is more than 9 ft, distance between each flag in the banner can be freely adjusted as desire, making it prominent and ideal for any occasion/place. Eco-friendly Reusable 100% biodegradable Environmentally safe You deserve the peace of celebrating an occasion without harming the environment or eco-system. This banner is thoughtfully designed with high quality natural jute fiber which is 100% biodegradable and environmentally safe, a beautiful and natural product. Lasting Impression This beautiful burlap banner comes in a cute PINK color bag - a good present to delight people. Superb for baby shower, baby hamper/ first birthday OR as a decor gift for home, church, garden and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81R+eItG2wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FaiR Banner","source_asin":"B07458KWNZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-433040","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07458KWNZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07458KWNZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
