window.products.push({"id":433151,"name":"Sival Chili Pepper Rista Cluster - Red/Green/Yellow 50 Light Brown Wire","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61X8AzFNfWL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This multi-color chili light cluster is an obvious choice for your next fiesta or Cinco de Mayo celebration. These lighted chili ristras are also a great choice for restaurants, patios, porches or anywhere you want to show some southwestern style! Hanging chili ristras are tradition of the southwest. Early southwest settlers would hang a chili ristra outside their door to let travelers know they had food and shelter available. Today the ristra remains a symbol of hospitality.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61X8AzFNfWL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sival","source_asin":"B0041DKEPS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-433151","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0041DKEPS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0041DKEPS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":433152,"name":"Mason Jar Flower Lights, Starry String Lights with Remote Control & Timer, 15 LEDs Rustic Home Hydrangea Fairy Light for Farmhouse, Living Room, Art, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZMhW96R1S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Brand: Cynzia Hydrangea color: blue String light color: cold white  -The artificial flowers on the mason jar lid design better decorate your home. -Mason jar lid lights are NOT WATERPROOF, please do not place them in rainy or wet places. -Decorative Decor Lights for bedroom, bathroom, baby nursery, sitting room, hotel, BBQ restaurant.  Specifications: LED Qty: 15 Leds String length: 59inches Blubs Spacing: 3.94inch (10cm) Power Source: 3*AAA batteries(battery not included) 3 Modes: steady on, flashing and timing. Package Includes: 1 * Flower Mason Jar Lid 1 * Mason Jar 1 * 3 Modes Remote Control","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZMhW96R1S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cynzia","source_asin":"B08DC95HZV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-433152","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DC95HZV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DC95HZV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":433153,"name":"Mattel Games Apples to Apples Junior the Game of Crazy Comparisons! [Packaging May Vary]","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qsXB3EdhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description The Apples to Apples Junior family party game is made especially for kids. Designed for younger members of the family, it's as easy as comparing \"apples to apples.\" With a hilarious mix of kid-friendly cards, it will keep younger players laughing while building vocabulary and thinking skills. Each round, the \"judge\" plays a Green Apple card, like \"Amazing.\" The other players choose their best match from the Red Apple cards in their hand, such as \"The Last Day of School.\" Trying to convince the judge that your card is the best answer is part of the fun! Colors and decorations may vary. From the Manufacturer \"APPLES to APPLES JUNIOR brings the hilarious card and party game, Apples to Apples, to younger players. Players aged nine and up will delight in all the crazy comparisons, while expanding their vocabulary and thinking skills at the same time. The game is as easy as comparing apples to apples – just open the box, deal the RED APPLE cards to each player, and you’re ready to go! Players take turns being the judge. The judge starts each round by playing a GREEN APPLE card featuring a one-word characteristic such as Chewy, Amazing or Scary. The rest of the players must then look at the RED APPLE cards in their hands and select the one they think is best described by the judge’s card – will you play A Volcano, Unicorns or Burned Toast? When everyone’s RED APPLE cards are on the table, you should try to convince the judge that yours is the best match. You’ll find that table talk is a big part of the fun. Just wait until you hear all the clever – and not so clever – ways that people try to convince the judge to choose a particular card. Do your best, because if the judge picks your card, you win that round! The first player to win four rounds wins the game. With over 500 cards, each round is filled with surprising comparisons from a wide range of people, places, things and events. Fast-moving and refreshing, Apples to Apples Junior is easy to learn and fun to play. It’s the perfect game for kids, families and friends!\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qsXB3EdhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mattel Games","source_asin":"B07S3X2NW3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-433153","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07S3X2NW3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07S3X2NW3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
