window.products.push({"id":433210,"name":"Aqonsie Inflatable Travel Pillow Neck Pillow/Travel Pillow Ultra Light Compressible Comfortable and Lightweight Neck Pillow Suitable for Airplanes Off","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qgGTSrY1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Easy to use】This is an inflatable cushion with a pump; it is equipped with a pump valve for easy inflation, so you don't have to use your mouth to blow it. Automatic inflation (very hygienic) is also very easy to vent air. You only need to press the flap with your finger and the air will escape. 【3D Hump Ergonomic Design】Due to the ergonomic hump design, you can relax with this neck pillow. The neck pillow is designed to support the cervical spine, which reduces the load on the vertebrae. In addition, the neck brace can relieve and relax the neck muscles by supporting the head and neck, despite sitting for long periods of time. 【Foldable and easy to carry】The portable storage bag can be easily folded and stored, and it is easy to carry without taking up luggage space. In addition, because it is an air-inflated model, it can be used anytime and anywhere, which is very convenient for long-term travel,home, office, car, train and airplane. Ideal for personal use or as a gift to your family and friends. 【skin-friendly fabric & removable cleaning】 This inflatable neck pillow features a lightweight, soft, upgraded version of high-quality crystal velvet skin-friendly fabric that is breathable and elastic, ultra-soft and have a smooth touch. And you can remove the cover and clean it. 【Multipurpose use of Inflatable neck pillow】When traveling, driving or traveling on business, it can be a partner for long-term travel or travel such as airplanes, bullet trains and buses. You can enjoy your vacation slowly at the office or at home. It will be a good choice for gifts for your own, family and friends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qgGTSrY1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aqonsie","source_asin":"B07ST1BKBL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-433210","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ST1BKBL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ST1BKBL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
