window.products.push({"id":433256,"name":"Popular Pretty Aspen Bathroom Shower Curtain, Shower Rings Included 100% Polyester Waterproof 60\" x 72\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jK4fjQKfL._AC_.jpg","description":"This shower curtain is made of 100% polyester, waterproof polyester durable fabric, environmentally friendly. Machine wash cold. Please do not bleach or tumble dry. Our product is designed to fit standardized bath tubs. Soft and comfortable hand feeling, simple and fashion design. You could see the holes with enough rings to attach, fitted with C-shaped curtain hooks. Good quality, favorable return policy, usually delivered in 8-12 business days.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jK4fjQKfL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shower Curtain","source_asin":"B00VR2J7D6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-433256","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00VR2J7D6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00VR2J7D6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":433257,"name":"Evergreen Elf - Tree Water/Moisture Level Monitor - Fits All Tree Stands - Help Keep Trees Healthier Longer - Comes with Light Indicator as a Water Le","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.08,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cFXFfN1jL._AC_SL1197_.jpg","description":"Everyone who has ever has tried to keep the water level up on a tree the hardest part about owning one of those trees, is to make sure that it remains healthy. Making sure that the tree has enough water is difficult for everyone. It is it tough on the back and the knees to constantly have to go down and check the water level. Due to the troubles of constantly watering a tree many family trees die way too early. It is easy to either forget to water it or misjudge the water level in the tree stand. Evergreen Elf is the solution to the age old problem. It removes the need to constantly check the water level of the tree as the Evergreen Elf checks it for you. Simply adjust the measuring stick on the back to the height of the tree stand and when the water level lowers to the end of the stick the Evergreen Elf will let you know. A light on the front of the Elf will light up letting you know that you have to fill the water up. The Elf has 2 alerts; one when your water level is low and the other for when the batteries (not included) are dying.Your Evergreen Elf will help you keep your tree healthy the whole season. Always remember that a healthy tree is a safe tree! When your Christmas tree dries out you have a higher risk of it catching fire. When a dry needle on the tree is exposed to a hot lightbulb for long hours there is chance that the needle will catch fire. With the Evergreen Elf you decrease the chance that the needle will dry out to much and catch fire from the heated lightbulb. Quickly get the Evergreen Elf and make your Christmas that much more festive!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cFXFfN1jL._AC_SL1197_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Evergreen","source_asin":"B0764JQ5Y6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-433257","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0764JQ5Y6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0764JQ5Y6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
