window.products.push({"id":433321,"name":"Wallies Wallpaper Big Flowers Mural, Set of 3 Sheets","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":46.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51nK4a7exEL._AC_.jpg","description":"With its lush colors and playful feel, the Big Flowers mural set from Wallies turns a bedroom or lounging area into a blooming world. Pre-pasted for simple application, the vinyl-coated wallpaper pieces require just a wash of water to activate their stickiness and then can adhere to almost any smooth surface. Designed for versatile arrangement, the set features large blooms to center a grouping as well as small ones for creating borders or dotting a room with accents. Throughout the set, the stylized shapes and complementary colors provide harmony and variety at once. The biggest flower, an orange-centered pink blossom, measures 29 by 60 inches, while its smaller blue cousin comes in at 24 by 40 inches. An array of 24 small blossoms and 11 dots rounds out the set. Washable with a damp cloth, the mural is acid- and lignin-free and strippable when it comes time to re-decorate.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51nK4a7exEL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wallies","source_asin":"B0012OV3Y0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-433321","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0012OV3Y0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0012OV3Y0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
