window.products.push({"id":433396,"name":"Mod Pods II Canvas Wall Art Print, Artwork","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Tn9ntYrqL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"SIZE: 30\" W x 40\" H x 1.25\" D. Orientation of canvas is vertical. READY TO HANG: Canvas comes with pre-installed hanging hardware already attached to the back of the product, so all that remains once received is hanging a nail on your wall for final installation. Infographic for hardware shown in product images. MADE IN USA: Canvas is handcrafted and made-to-order in the United States using high quality artist-grade canvas and archival inks that prevent against fading and preserve as much fine detail and vivid color as possible. Product also comes with a finished back. PERFECT FOR ANY SPACE: Living room, family room, bedroom, bathroom, office, kitchen, dining room, game room, bar, and more! SATISFACTION GUARANTEE: Please note that screens can vary in color and brightness, which can cause some printed products to appear slightly different from the online preview. If you are not satisfied with your purchase, please contact us directly through your order history and we would be more than happy to assist you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Tn9ntYrqL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CANVAS ON DEMAND","source_asin":"B084GJHPM6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-433396","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084GJHPM6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084GJHPM6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":433397,"name":"Premium Wine Decanter Drying Stand | With Bonus Decanter Cleaning Pallets| Fully Rubber Coated Scratch Proof Stainless Steel |Luxury Gift Box Included","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818IkQux+xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"How often have you been frustrated because your wine decanter was a problem to clean, and if you leave it on a rack to dry, it easily falls and breaks? The reality is wine enthusiasts love their decanters, so having a stable and chipproof decanter drying stand allows you to rest easy, knowing your elegant decanter will suffer no harm. Coolinary’s decanter stand provides exactly that, including metallic beads to help you to clean the decanter with ease. The special coating means your decanter will never chip and will keep your decanter safe and secure. The elegant carton packaging, black with silver lining, adds a rich a luxurious look to this set, giving it a million-dollar look. It’s a wonderful gift for you or for any wine lover in your life! Get the wine lover in your life a gift that will keep on giving. Order one now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818IkQux+xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Coolinary","source_asin":"B01N7C2FYX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-433397","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N7C2FYX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N7C2FYX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":433398,"name":"Breadman PZ200 Pizza Oven","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4170A2ANG6L.jpg","description":"Amazon.com I've always considered pizza to be the perfect food; it's economical, portable, delicious, and--properly prepared--contains all the food groups. If you file pizza under J for junk food, you've probably been buying those limp and greasy slices that sit under a heat lamp for hours. Homemade pizza allows you to control the ingredients, the temperature, and the cheesiness, and it's definitely faster than ordering on a raining Friday night. Breadman's 12-inch oven bakes a pizza that's fully loaded with fresh ingredients in just 20 minutes, and heats a frozen pizza in only 15. The nonstick coating allows the pizza to slide out easily, and the patented heat distribution system prevents undercooked middles and burnt crust. The baking component is removable and dishwasher-safe for easy cleaning, although you should be careful not to clean with any abrasives that could damage the nonstick surface. The oven handles stay cool, so you can serve pizza right from the pizza oven. It comes with an instruction book that has recipes for both pizzas and calzones, although with pizza, you're only limited by your imagination. --Laura Cuthbert","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4170A2ANG6L.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Breadman","source_asin":"B00004R93T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-433398","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00004R93T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00004R93T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
