window.products.push({"id":433456,"name":"Snowflake Christmas Stocking Holder Stocking Hanger for Fireplace- Weighted Stocking Holder for Mantel- Silver Metal Mantel Stocking Holders - Christm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UUOzistfL._AC_SL1315_.jpg","description":"This Christmas stocking holder set has a superb design, crafted with high-quality plated nickel and enriched with silver glitters, for a plus of elegance and shine. The decoration is resistant and durable, elevating your holiday décor for years to come.  Suitable occasions: These mantelpiece hook hangers are practical yet ornamental, very suitable for Christmas party and home using, you can use them to hang stockings with gifts in Christmas holiday, add some festive atmosphere to your activities.  Specifications: Material: Zinc Alloy Color: Silver   Each Measures: 4.9 Inches Wide x 5.3 Inches Tall x 2.75 Inches Deep (4.9\"x5.3\"x2.7\")  Quantity: 1 piece snowflake Christmas stocking hanger for mantel  These festive snowflake stocking holder are perfect to adorn your home and create a warm, cheerful atmosphere to celebrate with your family!   Sits Well On Mantels, Bookshelves, Tables, Staircases, Etc. Each hanger is chrome electroplated, which makes this stocking holder set stay shiny and elegant through your holiday.  Widely Applications - Set on top of a bookcase, shelf, stair cases or mantel, can easily hold most stockings.Widely used to hang Christmas ornaments, holiday season décor, stockings, garlands and lights  Easy to Use: Christmas stocking holders for mantle are easy to use. Just set them on the ledge and hang your stocking on the attached hook. Perfect for any tabletop, shelf, bookcase or mantle.  Nickel plated stocking holders with silver gliters; Strong hooks for hanging Christmas stockings;  High weight resistance;  Superior stability on smooth surfaces;  Ideal for fireplace, mantle, shelf; Dimensions snowflake: 5-inch wide base, 4-inch tall flake;  Make your home look festive and cheerful with our Christmas stocking holder set!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UUOzistfL._AC_SL1315_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kersiki","source_asin":"B0B8CJ8W7P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-433456","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8CJ8W7P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8CJ8W7P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
