window.products.push({"id":433552,"name":"Bulova Clocks C4834 Luxfer Prism 14 Inch Frank Lloyd Wright Inspired Wall Clock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WbPI2Io4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add some modern flair to your home with a wall clock influenced by the designs of a famous architect. The Bulova Clocks Luxfer Prism 14-Inch Wall Clock extracts the stylings of the late Frank Lloyd Wright and incorporates them into its beautiful construction. Frank Lloyd Wright designed and patented a series of 45 prisms of clear glass tiles to refract light for the Luxfer Prism Company building in Buffalo, New York. The front and rear walls of the building were made entirely of these Luxfer Prisms. This clock incorporates 2 of the famous prism designs, including the flower design that was the only one that was ever actually produced. The clock's case is made of individual bronze finished rods. The dial has raised hour markers on a cream background with a shadow background design. With its quartz crystal timekeeping, this clock ensures precise, long-lasting performance. It requires 1 unincluded AA battery. Give any room in your house a tasteful and functional piece of decor with the Bulova Clocks Luxfer Prism Frank Lloyd Wright-Inspired Wall Clock.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WbPI2Io4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bulova","source_asin":"B01D3BVD5I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-433552","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01D3BVD5I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01D3BVD5I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
