window.products.push({"id":433597,"name":"Beco Home Bedding Collection: 8 Piece Bed-in-a-Bag Comforter Set, Maya (Leopard Print), Full","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aqlbNVmRL._AC_.jpg","description":"Give your bedroom a beautiful, fashion-forward look with the Beco Home Maya bedding collection. This luxurious, comforter set provides an all-inclusive bedding solution that features a modern look with a complementary color scheme. The 8 piece bed-in-a-bag set includes 1 comforter, 1 fitted sheet, 1 flat sheet, 2 pillow cases, 2 pillow shams, and 1 decorative accent pillow. The down-alternative comforter is filled with 100% white bonded polyester; derived from clean, non-recycled fibers bonded together that reinforces the material to prevent shifting. The comforter also has quilted channels, which further prevents the fiber filling from shifting, especially after washing. It features a fill power of 200 GSM (grams per square meter), making it ideal for all-season use. Polyester fabric in this bedding collection is hypoallergenic, making it a great choice for those who suffer from allergies. Comforter dimensions: Full (78\" W x 90\" L), Queen (90\" W x 90\" L), and King (106\" W x 90\" L). Bedding features 100% peach finished microfiber polyester, a brushing technique which makes the fabric soft to the touch. The fitted sheet accommodates mattresses up to 15\" H. A decorative pillow completes this bedroom set. The Beco Home Maya bedding collection is machine washable in cold water, on delicate cycle; tumble dry on low.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aqlbNVmRL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beco Home","source_asin":"B06X9MWN38","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-433597","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06X9MWN38","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06X9MWN38","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
