window.products.push({"id":433793,"name":"Think Home Art 3 Piece Stainless Steel Bar Spoons/Cocktail Shaker with Spiral (Twist-Neck) Pattern and EBook","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yI8q1vVDL._AC_SL1017_.jpg","description":"Do you love mixing cocktails at home but have no idea how to make them as good as the ones you get from your favorite bar? Well, you can start learning with the Think Home Art Bar Spoon Set. This is a very versatile tool that can help consumers make their own cocktails at home and many more! Think Home Art is a company that aims to give only the best to its customers. It is a brand that prides in the fact that it provides its consumers with tools that can improve their day to day activities. The Think Home Art 11-inch bar spoon is a relatively simple tool but it is a proven essential in any household that aims to entertain guests. It is an 11-inch spiral spoon that can help evenly mix various drinks like milkshakes, dressings, various juices, and, of course, cocktails. It has a uniquely shaped base that is perfect for crushing any solid ingredients like fresh fruits and herbs. The twisted design is perfect for giving users a better grip while mixing. It is specifically designed to help consumers make the perfect drinks without trouble. Benefits The best thing about this product is that it comes with a money-back guarantee! In case you are not 100% satisfied with our product, you can get a full refund as long as you return the product within 30 days from purchase. Now, you can enjoy your favorite drinks in the comforts of your own home! You no longer have to go to a bar and spend hundreds of dollars for a drink that can be done at home. With the Think Home Art Bar Spoon Set, you can even come up with your very own concoctions! So, what are you waiting for? Get 3 bar spoons in 1 set now! Life Time Guarantee","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yI8q1vVDL._AC_SL1017_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Think Home Art","source_asin":"B0186CR0KG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-433793","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0186CR0KG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0186CR0KG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":433794,"name":"Creative Converting Lei and Headband, Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.24,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qUG0v9tgL._AC_.jpg","description":"The blue lei and headband is great for a male guest who wants to look like a native Hawaiian! One lei and one headband in each package. Look for other luau party decor and accessories by Creative Converting. Whether you're planning an intimate dinner, a family gathering, or a huge party, you can trust Creative Converting for high quality, consistent color matching and attention to detail.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qUG0v9tgL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Creative Converting","source_asin":"B00BMUEQAM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-433794","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BMUEQAM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BMUEQAM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":433795,"name":"Set of 6 XXL LYCIA Pestemal Towels Turkish Cotton Bath Beach Hammam Towel Peshtemal Throw Blanket (Campaign Lara)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91fxM1RdsnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Set of 6 XXL LYCIA Pestemal Towels Turkish Cotton Bath Beach Hammam Towel Peshtemal Throw Blanket (Campaign Lara)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91fxM1RdsnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GOLD CASE","source_asin":"B08QN71YFV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-433795","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QN71YFV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QN71YFV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":433796,"name":"Pozolero Bowl Pozolero de Barro 8\" Mexican Soup Bowl.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ILm3r3cAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Barro literally means \"mud\" but generally means \"clay,\" This Barro Rojo Bowl is made by artisans living in the Oaxacan highlands. The red clay is gathered from the surrounding hills. Bits of wood, stone and corn are used as tools to mould the clay on a traditional banding wheel. The pottery is burnished using a stone and brush to give it a smooth unglazed finish. Finally it is pit fired under corrugated metal with wood, sawdust and cardboard. This technique has been passed down through generations for hundreds of years in this village.Mexican bowls are made of earthenware or \"clay\" or in Spanish \"barro\". The bowls maybe glazed inside or out (or both) then fired over low heat. The results are earthy, stunning and a pleasure to use. Clay has been traditionally used in Mexican cooking because the clay imparts a specific flavor to the foods that can't be reproduced in a metal pot. Before use, be sure to cure by using a simple seasoning process before you use the bowl. Fill the bowl with water and place it over a direct flame. If you have an electric stove then you should use a diffuser or buy a small portable gas burner. Allow the water to boil for a few minutes then remove from the heat and discard. Do this twice. Add a bit of Mexican pottery to your table with this gorgeous handmade Barro bowl. They are beautifully hand painted with little green or black and cream colored flowers flowers. The special and authentic hand shaping of the dishes makes them unique in proportion ....an element that makes handmade so beautifully perfect. Excellent for Pozole, Menudo, Caldos and Soups. There are no breaks, but please keep in mind that this clay material is hand handled, shaped and made; minimal chipping is natural. They are ready for use and certainly to add a bit of Mexican style decor to any table setting or folk kitchen. With this product you aren’t just buying a dish but rather a piece of Artistry. Barro Pozolero is 3 inches in Height, with a Top Diameter of 8","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ILm3r3cAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kitchen & Restaurant Supplies","source_asin":"B07DGQXNXG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-433796","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DGQXNXG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DGQXNXG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
