window.products.push({"id":433864,"name":"Huskee Cup + Lid Natural (16oz)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Fh51oaEEL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"HuskeeCup’s unique thermal properties will keep your coffee hotter for longer. So whether you are at home, on the go, or dining in at a café, you can expect an improved coffee experience. HuskeeCup has a slim and grip-able form. And it’s fins are not only an iconic design feature – they also protect your hands from the heat of your drink. You’re going to love the way that it feels to hold HuskeeCup (whether with one hand or both)! HuskeeCup is designed to last for years (even in a cafe environment). It’s durable and it doesn’t chip or crack easily. We have tested it in even the most rigorous café environments, running it through the dishwasher dozens of times a day. HuskeeCup features coffee husk as a raw material. The coffee husk is an organic waste material that’s produced at the milling stage of coffee production. Thus using this material makes the production of our coffee cup sustainable. By purchasing HuskeeCup, you are helping to recycle hundreds of tonnes of waste material from the production of coffee. We’ve developed this coffee cup with a lid and saucer that work with every cup size! Our lid and saucer are both made from the same unique sustainable husk material as HuskeeCup. Huskee’s Universal Saucer stacks neatly and the reusable coffee cups‘ universal lid has been designed to give you a cafe drinking experience on the go! Huskee’s Universal Lid has been designed with cleanliness in mind. It’s streamlined design means there’s nowhere for coffee to hide once you’ve given it a wash! Plus, HuskeeCup’s base features drainage vents that ensure water runs straight off the cup after cleaning. No more nasty liquid pools! Beyond function, HuskeeCup is recognized globally as an aesthetically pleasing, beautifully designed vessel. Additionally, HuskeeCup’s sustainable Universal Lid & Saucer are the perfect complement to its elegant and sophisticated aesthetic.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Fh51oaEEL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Huskee","source_asin":"B08VWRB3KR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-433864","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08VWRB3KR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08VWRB3KR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
