window.products.push({"id":433912,"name":"green sprouts Garden Lunch Bag, Sage Worm, 3 Months","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DIjUXQxHL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Reduce, Reuse, Recycle is the main idea behind source reduction. Addressing polluting materials before products are designed or produced is the most dependable way to prevent waste from occurring. We have intentionally reduced our packaging compared to previous designs. We have also removed known harmful toxins like PVC and BPA from our products. We know that lugging around everything parents need for their little ones can be a real chore. We have a collection of spill-proof, easy to carry feeding items to make life simpler when on-the-go. We use materials that are naturally absorbent without superabsorbent gels or harsh chemicals to keep your baby clean and happy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DIjUXQxHL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"i play.","source_asin":"B008818LQI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-433912","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008818LQI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008818LQI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":433913,"name":"Bedside Water Carafe Set with Tumbler, Bedside Carafe and Glass Set for Nightstand Bedroom Guest Room, Water Carafe for Cold Drink, Mouthwash Dispense","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41mznc5KyYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"💯This carafe has a simple and elegant appearance and a unique design. It consists of two parts, the carafe and the glass lid, compact and lightweight, easy to use, easy to clean. 💯The glass lid can not only keep the water in the carafe from being polluted by impurities in the air, but also can be used as a cup to drink water, which is very suitable for daily use. It is perfect for keeping water at your bedside, juice on your table, or mouthwash at your sink. 💯Material : glass; Size: 8.5cm(3.3in)*21.5cm(8.4in); Kettle capacity:750ml(25oz), Cup capacity:200ml(6.7oz) 💯The carafe can withstand instantaneous temperature differences, without fear of hot or cold water.This tumbler is perfect for keeping water at your bedside, juice on your table, or mouthwash at your sink. It works in a kitchen, at an office desk or for a guestroom. 💯If you receive any defective or broken products, please contact us at any time, we will provide you with a satisfactory solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41mznc5KyYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yalucky","source_asin":"B09PG8T47Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-433913","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PG8T47Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PG8T47Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":433914,"name":"Art Wall Koi with Japanese Maple Leaf Gallery Wrapped Canvas Art by Michael Creese, 48 by 36-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":130.91,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oJYp0bTfL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Michael Creese 'Koi with Japanese Maple Leaf' gallery-wrapped canvas is a high-quality canvas print depicting a koi fish swimming in a colorful pond with a maple leaf in the artist's signature vibrant, oil impasto style. A beautiful addition to your home or office. Michael Creese was born in Chicago, Illinois and studied art at Carnegie Mellon University, where he received a Bachelor of Fine Arts degree. He paints in the oil impasto style, a technique used in art where paint is laid thickly on canvas, leaving visible brush (or palette knife) strokes. When dry, impasto provides a great deal of texture to the finished painting. He also works with several other mediums in addition to oils. \"My particular style of painting is a culmination of my fine art training, my fondness for the Impressionist and Expressionist art movements and my personal artistic vision. Color and composition are two key elements to my creative process, but the application of paint is perhaps the single most important factor in defining my style, from loose brush strokes and rich texture to an almost frenzied use of palette knife marks. The colors that I use are frequently blended directly on the painting, adding liveliness through visibly distinct transitions in color and shade. I have been told that one of the nicest features of my style, even though it is representational, is its abstract quality. This is one aspect of painting that I truly enjoy and one that I have worked hard to preserve. But apart from all the explanations of technique or style, I think that you will find as I have that art is mostly a mystery so much more than the sum of its parts.\".","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oJYp0bTfL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ArtWall","source_asin":"B00HZJ48TS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-433914","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00HZJ48TS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00HZJ48TS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
