window.products.push({"id":433922,"name":"HueLiv 36x28 Inch LED Bathroom Vanity Mirror with Lights, 3X Magnification Touch Control Dimmable Makeup Mirror, IP44 Anti-Fog Separately, 3000-6000K ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61T1UCCIiBL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【3 Color Temperatures & Dimmable LED Mirror】HueLiv bathroom mirror adopts touch control design, which is more aesthetic and elegant. 3 color temperatures are available. You can choose 3000K warm white to 6000K cool white according to your needs. The vanity mirror with lights is also stepless dimming. You could just touch the button for 3 seconds to change the LED from 10% to 100%, which allows you to appreciate yourself in the most realistic light for makeup and skin care. 【Unique Design & Defogging Function】Different from conventional mirrors, HueLiv lighted bathroom mirror has the anti-fog function, which could eliminates the fog. It’s the dual touch control button design. You don't need to worry that the steam full of the mirror, it will defog automatically after it's turned on, which provides you a better shower experience. Adopts unique smooth edges technology, anti-rust treatment, not easy to be oxidized and rust. It's more durable for years use. 【3x Magnifying Lens & Modern Style】The 5MM HD lighted vanity mirror is undoubtedly stylish. The built-in round 3x magnification is integrated with the glass. You can see the details of face easily. It's suitable for daily use, such as shaving, makeup, etc. There is not only 0.78IN width led light on the surface of mirror, but also the additional LED light embedded on the side of mirror. The mirror comes with IP44 and moisture-proof backing, ensuring safe lighting in humid bathroom environments. 【2 Hanging Methods & More Choices】36X28 inch bathroom vanity mirror can be hung vertically or horizontally. Length of power plug wire is 6.56FT. The control of power ON/OFF and defogging is individual, so you could use the defogging function separately as your preference. Please be advised that mirror couldn't be controlled by the wall switch. You could turn on/off and adjust the brightness/color temperature through the switch on the mirror. 【UL Listed Power & Great Packaging】The power supply is UL approved, which is much safer. The net weight of mirror is 11kgs. Good packaging can better protect each side of the mirror, especially the corners of the mirror. The bathroom vanity mirror passed all tests, including drop, impact, heavy pressure test, etc. If there is anything wrong with the led vanity mirror you receive, please feel free to contact us and we will give the best solution to satisfy you 100%.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61T1UCCIiBL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HueLiv","source_asin":"B08J7LW265","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-433922","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08J7LW265","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08J7LW265","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
